cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "passmcp-lsp: a language server for MCP artefacts"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/passmcp-lsp"
abstract: >-
  A Language Server Protocol server over stdio for Model Context Protocol
  artefacts: it validates server.json registry listings against the MCP
  Registry schema, MCP client configurations, MCP tool definitions, and
  passmcp acceptance policies and attestations, and shows passmcp's
  remediation guidance on hover over a check id.
keywords:
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - language-server
  - lsp
  - golang
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.0.3
date-released: 2026-09-30
